  "id": "test-of-nonverbal-intelligence",
  "term": "Test of Nonverbal Intelligence",
  "definition": "The Test of Nonverbal Intelligence is a nonverbal assessment used to measure intelligence, especially fluid reasoning, through tasks such as geometric patterns, visual relationships, and problem solving without spoken or written language. It is intended to reduce the influence of language, schooling, and cultural background on test performance.",
